<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dial raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dial raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Dial Corp to outperform from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Monday at 12-3/8.</p>
</text>
